        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu na nkīma Nsamalia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū Seeba akadeeba gīkī, a Bafalisayo bigwile gīkī ū Yesu akūpandīkaga bahemba bingī kūtinda ū Yohana, na kūbabatīīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Yesu walī atabatīījaga ū wei ng'wenekīlī, babatīījaga bahemba bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wagūdeeba ū mhayo gwenūyo, wīnga ī Būyudaya ūja hangī Galilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzīla īyo akabītīla yalī ībītile mu Samalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshika mu nzengo nebe gwa Samalia, gwitanagwa Sikali, gwalī hihī n'ilaale ilebe, Yakobo walī wang'winha ng'witūnja wakwe Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwalīmo na lwinzī lokwe ū Yakobo. Hūna lūūlū ū Yesu īkī walī wanojiwa lūgendo, aho washika a ha lwinzī lwenūlo wigasha; gaalī makanza gītī ga sa itandatū limi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla nkīma Nsamalia wiza kūdaha minzī; ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Mayū ninhage minzī nang'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba bakwe baalī baja mu nzengo kūjūgūla shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ū Nsamalia ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla gīkī, “Tūhaya ūlī Nyudaya ahene ū bebe, hama nibūlī ūlīnilomba minzī, alīyo ū nene nalī nkīma Nsamalia?” (Nguno a Bayudaya batī na būsangī na Basamalia). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, Ūlū ni ulimanile īlī nong'ho lya ng'wa Mulungu, nū yūyo alīkūwīla gīkī, ‘Ninhage minzī nang'we,’ nang'ho ni wanomba akwinhe minzī gali na bupanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūng'wīla gīkī, “Bebe baba wagafunya halī a minzī gali na bupanga, alīyo nī lidahījo ūtī nalyo; hama nū lwinzī lwenūlū lūshimu gīkī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūlī ntaale kūnkīla ū sīswe ū Yakobo, ūyo watūlekela ū lwinzī lwenūlū? Īkī nū wei ng'wenekīlī wang'welaga henaha aha, pye na a baana bakwe, nī mitugo jakwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, “Būlī ng'wene ūyo akagang'waga a minzī genaya akakolagwa nota hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ose ose ūyo ūgang'wa a minzī ayo nakūng'winha nene, atūkolwa nota welelo bose, a minzī ayo nakūng'winha gakūbiza lūzwīlo ū mulī wei, lwa kwikala lūkūpumunhikaga būja na būja pyī ī shikū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ninhage nane baba a minzī genayo, nooye ū kūkolwa ī nota, nooye na kwikala niza aha kūdaha minzī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Jaga ūkang'witane ū ngoshi wako ng'wize aha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, “Natī na ngosha wane.” Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Watūngīlīja ū kūhaya gīkī, ‘Natī na ngosha wane.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno washishaga bagosha batanò, hama nū yūyo ūlī nang'hwe ī haha atī ngoshi wako. Ohaya ūmo īlī gete!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūng'wīla, “Baba ī gete nabona ūlī ng'hangi ū bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakūlūgenji bise balamījaga mu lūgūlū lwenūlū ūlū, alīyo a bing'we mukahayaga gīkī ī lipandī īlo shiigeleelilwe kūlamīja moilīī Yelusalemu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Nizunīlījage gete mayū; gīkī, līliza ikanza īlo mukoya kūgonga kūnamīja ū Baba mu lūgūlū ūmu, nūūlū Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mukalamyaga īsho mutashimanile, alīyo a bise tūkanamyaga ūyo tūūmanile; nguno ū būpīji būfumile kū Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī likanza līliza, nīyo ī haha līlīho, ī lya balamya ba ng'wa ng'hana kūyūnamya ū Baba mu moyo na mu ng'hana; nguno ū Baba abatogilwe a balamya abo bakanamyaga mu mbika yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu alī Moyo, a balamya bakwe nabo shibigelile kūnamya mu moyo na mu ng'hana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ūng'wīla, “Namanile gīkī akwiza Masīya, ūyo akitanagwa Kilisito, na lūūlū ūlū wiza ū ng'wenūyo, hū ng'wene ūyo akūtūgoloolela pyī ī yose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūng'wīla, Ū Nene ūyo nalīyomba nang'ho, hū nalī ng'wene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo būshika a bahemba bakwe, būkumya ū kūmona alīyomba na nkīma. Alīyo nūūlū ūmò wabo atabūgije gīkī, Ūlīkooba kī?” Nūūlū gīkī, “Nibūlī ūlīhoya nang'hwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūlūleka ū lūnno lokwe ūshoka mu nzengo ūūkabawīla a banhū gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bing'we ka nzūgwi kūūnū munole ūūyū munhū, waniwīla pyī īyo nakīītaga; akūduuma kūbiza Kilisito gete ū ng'wenūyū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būfuma ū mu nzengo būhūūma bajile ūko walī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo a bahemba būng'wīla ū Yesu gīkī, “Rabi ka lyaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla, Ū nene nalī na shilīwa īsho mutashimanile a bing'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba būyiwīla gīkī, “Hamo munhū walī wang'wenhela shilīwa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla, “Ī shilīwa shane ū nene, shilī kwīta īyo atogilwe ūyo anitūmile; kūgūshikīlīja ū nīmo gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī mutiwīlaga gīkī, ‘Yasaagaga myeji īne gashike magesa?’ Ali lūūlū, ī haha nalīmuwīla būūchagi a miso ging'we, mulole ū mu migūnda, mukūbona gīkī a magesa gashikaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha ū ngesi wandije kwanukūla mheela, akūkumingaga matwajo kūlwa būpanga, bupanga butashilaga; ībize gīkī ū ngesi nū mībi bayegele hamò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu gīko gūkubiza gūlī gwa ng'hana ū mhayo ūyo gūhayile gīkī, ‘Ū mībi ūngī, nū ngesi ūngī.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmutūma kūshigesa īsho mutashikoyelile a bing'we, bashikoyela bangī; a bing'we mulingīla mu nīmo ūyo gwandiwa na bangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basamalia bingī ū mu nzengo gwenūyo bakanzunya, kūlwa mhayo gwa nkīma ūyo akagūhaya; ī gīkī, “Waniwīlaga pyī īyo nakīītaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a Basamalia aho bashika, būnomba ū Yesu alende lende hamò nabo; na ng'hana wikala nabo shikū ibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bangī hangī bakazunya kūlwa mhayo gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla ū nkīma gīkī, “Ī haha twigwaga bise benekīlī, na lūūlū twazunyaga; alīyo ītī kūlwa nguno ya mhayo gwako dūhū, twamanaga gete gīkī ū munhū ng'wenūyū ng'hana Mpīja wa ba mu sī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa kwa ng'witūnja wa nsugi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jabīta shikū ibīlī, ū Yesu wīnga a henaho ūja Galilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike walī wamala kūhaya hape gīkī, Ū ng'hangi atinhagwa ikūjo ū mu sī ya ng'wawe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho washika ī Galilaya bingī ba bana Galilaya būng'wanukūla, nguno baalī bībona īyo akībeeja aho alī Yelusalemu kū shigukulu, īkī nabo baalī ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūja ūūkashika hangī ī Kana ya Galilaya, ūko walī wagalūcha minzī gūbiza mvinya. Walīho nsugi nebe muna Kapelanaumu, walī asaatīlilwe ng'witūnja wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wigwa gīkī ū Yesu wīngile ī Būyudaya, alī mu Galilaya, wiza kūng'wikūmbīlīja atulumenhe, aje akampīje ū ng'wana wakwe. Nguno walī mandetendete, hihī na kūcha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu ūng'wīla gīkī, “A bing'we ūlū mutabonile shimanīkījo nūūlū mihayo ya kūkumya, angū mmho mutūdūla gete ū kūzunya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsugi ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla gīkī, “Baba ka tulumenhaga wangū, kūko kataalī kūcha u ngwanone!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūng'wīla gīkī, “Jaga ū ng'wana wako mpanga.” Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūgūzunya ū mhayo ūyo akawīlwa na Yesu, ūja ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alīshoka ūmanhya na batūmami bakwe, būng'wīla gīkī ū ng'witūnja wakwe wapīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūbabūja ī likanza īlo akandya kūbeeja, būng'wīla, “Igolo aho lyandya kūhūga ī līīmi; mu makanza gītī ga sa mpungatī, gwandya kwika ū nswiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū ise ūmana hū lyene ī likanza īlo Yesu akang'wīla gīkī, Ū ng'wana wako mpanga.” Na lūūlū ūbiza nzunya, nī kaya yakwe pyī ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shenīsho shalī shimanīkījo sha kabīlī īsho a kabeeja ū Yesu aho alī mu sī ya Galilaya, hanze ya Būyudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
